# Fixed defect 580, 2026-10-10 (panel 207 R3; the critic's `s02`): a cell a
# branch writes is uncertain after it, since the walk decides no condition,
# so `v + 100` after `if 1 < 2` writing 200 is not judged. It aborts where `V`
# is read, as overflow aborts at every width (spec § 7), the `1` before it
# flushed first.

constant V: u8
    v: u8 @ 0

    if 1 < 2
        v @ 200

    v + 100

function main()
    print(1)
    print(V)
